--- Numeric Comparisons ---
10 < 20: true
20 <= 20: true
30 > 15: true
15 >= 15: true
10 == 10: true
10 != 20: true
--- String Comparisons ---
'apple' == 'apple': true
'apple' != 'banana': true
'apple' < 'banana': false
--- Nil and Mixed-Type Equality ---
nil == nil: true
nil != 0: true
false == false: true
true != false: true
10 == '10': false
--- Collection Equality ---
[1, 2] == [1, 2]: true
[1, 2] != [3, 4]: true
